  "details": "<p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/2533/pleiades/search/jordan/titleCreatorYear/items/G2EFL6NK/item-list\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">H\u00fclsen (HJ 216)</a> contended that the arch was to be located near the stream of the Almo outside the Porta S. Sebastiano.</p>",
